      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 8.06,
          "en": "Now with all these bindings you hopefully got an overview of how you can work with Svelte",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.06,
          "end": 12.72,
          "en": "and its bindings to conveniently get access to form values and using two-way binding here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 12.72,
          "end": 16.9,
          "en": "really is extremely helpful and you'll often use it when working with forms.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 17.88,
          "end": 23.4,
          "en": "There is another way of getting access to any element on the page though, so besides using",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 23.4,
          "end": 26.74,
          "en": "two-way binding and also not limited to inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 27.32,
          "end": 31.4,
          "en": "let me first demonstrate it with the help of an input though let's say here we",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 31.4,
          "end": 32.92,
          "en": "have an input and",
          "zh": ""
